.TH AICHAT-DESKTOP 1 "2026" "aichat-desktop" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aichat-desktop \- desktop chat window for Claude Code
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aichat-desktop
[\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-\-install\-desktop\fR | \fB\-\-uninstall\-desktop\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A PyQt6 window around the Claude Code command line (\fBclaude\fR): live tool and text streaming, a project folder per
chat, saved chats with Markdown export, Read only / Edit files / Full auto permission modes, queued messages, themes and
an optional credit counter. Requires the separate \fBclaude\fR command.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-install\-desktop, \-\-uninstall\-desktop
Add or remove the application menu entry and icons under ~/.local/share (for pip / pipx installs; the .deb ships its own).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/aichat\-desktop/
Settings, the optional API key (env, mode 0600), saved chats and the credit counter. Override with
.BR AICHAT_DESKTOP_CONFIG_DIR .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AICHAT_DESKTOP_CONFIG_DIR
Use this folder instead of the default config folder.
.TP
.B AICHAT_DESKTOP_HARD_PIXELS=0
Turn off the crisp-pixel text mode used on integer-scaled screens.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR claude (1)
.SH AUTHOR
NoobFromUA <https://github.com/NoobFromUA-YT>
